# selfremote gateway — 薄镜像构建（从预编译二进制打包；推荐流程：Windows 交叉编译 → 本地打包 → docker save → NAS 导入）
#
# 构建（项目根目录执行）：
#   GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go build -o dist/sr-linux-amd64 ./cmd/sr
#   docker build -f deploy/nas/Dockerfile.prebuilt -t selfremote:latest .
#   docker save selfremote:latest -o dist/selfremote-image.tar
FROM alpine:3

RUN apk add --no-cache iptables iptables-legacy

COPY dist/sr-linux-amd64 /usr/local/bin/sr
COPY deploy/nas/entrypoint.sh /usr/local/bin/entrypoint.sh
RUN chmod +x /usr/local/bin/entrypoint.sh

ENTRYPOINT ["/usr/local/bin/entrypoint.sh"]
CMD ["gateway", "-c", "/etc/selfremote/gateway.json"]
